          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#333333;" value="ℹ️ Monolith mode: oc-app.jar bundles Core + Executor — the Dispatcher calls the executor in-process, no broker needed. Distributed mode: the same code ships as oc-worker.jar; workers are FULLY ISOLATED — no MongoDB access, no persistent state: the job message carries everything (workflow snapshot, credentials, global params — encrypted on the broker) and all results leave as events. Only Core touches MongoDB; raw log files on a worker are a transient spool, not state. DAG Scheduler: data + control dependencies decide order — independent nodes and loop iterations run concurrently (bounded per external system); same-connector writes stay ordered unless the user marks a branch parallel-safe. Security: JWT, LDAP and TOTP 2FA exist today — OIDC is new in the rework; ACL: role-based RBAC (component × action) PLUS per-resource ACLs — platform-wide requirement, applied to workflows first: each workflow document carries its ACL, enforced in Mongo queries, REST and WebSocket topic subscriptions; execution logs inherit the workflow&#39;s ACL. WebSocket sessions live only in Core — live-run streams are fed from broker events, never from worker memory." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="800" x="240" y="1010" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#333333;" value="LEGEND&#xa;— solid black: synchronous call&#xa;-- dashed gray: async job delivery (broker)&#xa;-- dashed orange: async log / status events&#xa;-- dashed purple: pluggable transport (SPI)&#xa;·· dotted gray: build-time (Gradle artifacts)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="135" width="320" x="1160" y="920" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="modmap" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#666666;" value="GRADLE MODULES&#xa;common — shared contracts: workflow model, DTOs, transport SPI, ACL model&#xa;execution — engine library: DAG Scheduler, Workflow Executor, Request Builder, OcLogger&#xa;core → oc-app.jar · worker → oc-worker.jar" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="320" x="1160" y="1060" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
